672fc3a0229a0f986a29da9f95564659647f1a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Improves your ability to perform counterstrikes after blocks in the following ways:\n\t\tAllows counterstrikes after incomplete blocks.\n\t\tIncreases the number of counterstrikes you can perform on a target while they're vulnerable by %d.\n\t\tIncreases the crit chance of counterstrikes by %d%%. This increase scales with your Dexterity.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"通过以下方法提高你的反击能力：\n\t\t当你不完全格挡时，也可以进行反击。\n\t\t你对可反击目标的反击次数增加 %d 次。\n\t\t增加 %d%% 反击暴击率。\n\t\t受敏捷影响，此暴击率按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea3b5287775f5b1dc5c82e53b0baaef33c1b0e656b17ef53db291cdb82eb6710","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a64f1d671bbac5a93683014ae9a4e864c0962115cf04097d187aceb8a9e3c79","logical_entry_identity":"31fbba2fe8381fcc44b3a844fda7b4268867585062ff7dfd4d410cd9f651ea02","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Matter is energy, as any good Mindslayer knows. Unfortunately, the various bonds and particles involved are just too numerous and complex to make the conversion feasible in most cases. The ordered, crystalline structure of a gem, however, make it possible to transform a small percentage of its matter into usable energy.\n\t\tThis talent consumes one gem and grants %d psi per turn for between 5 and 13 turns, depending on the quality of the gem used.\n\t\tThis process also creates a resonance field that provides the (imbued) effects of the gem to you while this effect lasts.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"任何优秀的心灵杀手都知道，物质就是能量。遗憾的是，大多数物质由于分子成分的复杂性无法转换。然而，宝石有序的晶体结构使得部分物质转化为能量成为可能。\n\t\t这个技能消耗一个宝石，在 5~13 回合内，每回合获得 %d 灵能值，持续回合取决于所用的宝石品质。\n\t\t在持续时间内同时获得一个共振领域提供宝石的效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2a998b1dba7ddd21b189a03806dbaba35567e3f95de62926502e022949ef11da","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a692100d33582ba96323244a53111212fa9da63166cb4465e6a932d93472bb5","logical_entry_identity":"de80c4e9c31064089fee21178e67fd16f4e603ac6932891d09d4323be4f4a82e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Wrath of the Woods","source_tag":"_t","target":"丛林的愤怒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"492fc3061626cf3a4f85f80947a26b9b8b93b0bec8ae987530241c50b006cf71","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a708cf5f76494666fbd57b94232182683a4b6b366f86f6d54259369074250d9","logical_entry_identity":"ee6acb85c9db759b890518ee94878df40cd164347750cf57c418f13dfc83913c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"shining long sword","source_tag":"_t","target":"发光的长剑"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d9353d5bbc4ba5d90a457f7bfb173f87e682e0041632c4b1d0238a10211ed506","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a72954abad017dd22f8c5b251f423322309a0fe5dbea3e50eacaab231fb6ad8","logical_entry_identity":"b0e203975bb92779f3ddc7d6f8b2c6ff222f0794570ff46ac58c589a24df90b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Yes, Elisa, could you have a look at these objects please? [show her the items the orb could not identify]","source_tag":"_t","target":"是的，埃莉萨，能否请你帮我看看这些物品？[向她展示水晶球无法鉴定的物品]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b535512251df2035b20947c215b2d41b940dd4ee0e158f69d8f4186e67128bd6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a76d12643f3d43f1833380efde6919c806fbba99e549dd9a946064fdf798084","logical_entry_identity":"4c792e3a5de6c30aebb400293a9ef22f7b51e36268a560e69c9d16008ce0822a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dazzled","source_tag":"_t","target":"炫目"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1afcfd274dc04d118b116d7ee23d8fe9ef9658e9b64d3ed6e07a8b20cb3a50bb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a79af3a69eb9f48559373886a50843aa220c3a9c439fde9334616fc7919c08a","logical_entry_identity":"0b76b24e6ceb3b23f2c063b66a35836f6487acca22cdb5a897cf787572026a5e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Stone Gauntlets of Harkor'Zun","source_tag":"entity name","target":"哈克祖的岩石臂铠"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0caa7f6cbcf39b27b1621d84098ad37aa47cc72cd55e97cbd1be9b92ac8e7965","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5a7d451df11a7da